#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Zemljevidi"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Prikaži, kje so podjetja na zemljevidu, dajanje vsakega poštnega naslova offline na svojo poštno številko ali mesto od tabel, ki se hranijo na tem strežniku, ali kjer ste ga dali na roko; naslov stika in svoje so narisani samo, ko vprašate, in njihove točke se hranijo z njimi in izbrisani z njimi. Zemljevid je narisan z navodilom (BSD-2-Clause) na ploščicah OpenStreetMap († OpenStreetMap prispevajo, ODbL), razen če Nastavitve izberejo druge ploščice ali nič; OpenStreetMap nato spozna naslov vsakega gledalca in njegovo področje. Kraji prihajajo iz GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; njegove poštne kode CC BY 4.0), imena držav iz Unicode CLDR skozi Babel, in svet oris iz Naravne Zemlje (javna domena). Izklopljeno, ni strani z zemljevidom in naslov ni postavljen; koordinate, ki so že shranjene, ostanejo zabeležene in se vrnejo nedotaknjene, ko se ponovno vklopijo."
